hadiths[33]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1070","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo apne mushtaraka ghulam mein se apna hissa aazad kare, aur is ke paas ghulam ki qeemat ke barabar maal ho, to us par aadil qeemat lagai jaegi. Tamam shareekon ko in ke hisson ki qeemat is ke maal se di jaegi, aur ghulam is ki taraf se aazad ho jaega. Warna jitna hissa aazad hua hai woh aazad hai.'"
"1071","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo ghulam do shareekon ke darmiyan ho, aur un mein se ek apna hissa aazad kare, agar woh aazad karne wala maal-daar ho to us par buland ya aadil qeemat lagai jaegi, jo na kam ho na zyada, phir woh use maal se is ka hissa ada karega.'"
"1072","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ya aadmi ne apne chhe ghulam aazad kiye, jabke is ke paas in ke siwa koi maal na tha. Yeh muamla Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya, to Aap ne in ke darmiyan qura andazi ki aur in mein se ek tuhai ko aazad kiya. Imam Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aazad karne wale ki woh beemari thi jis mein woh faut hua."
"1073","[AI-translation] Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansar ka ek aadmi ne wafat ke waqt wasiyat ki aur chhe ghulam aazad kiye, jabke is ke paas in ke siwa koi maal na tha. Ya unhon ne kaha: Us ne wafat ke waqt chhe ghulam aazad kiye jabke is ke paas in ke siwa kuch na tha. To yeh muamla Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahuncha. To Aap ne is ke bare mein sakht kalima farmaya, phir unhen bulaya aur unhen teen hisson mein taqseem kiya. Phir in ke darmiyan qura andazi ki aur do ko aazad kiya aur chaar ko ghulam rakha."
"1074","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) mere paas aai aur kaha: 'Main ne apne maalikon se nau ooqiya par kitabat ki hai, har saal ek ooqiya, to meri madad karen.' To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne un se kaha: 'Agar tumhare maalik chahen ke main unhen yeh raqam gin dun, to main tayyar hun, lekin tumhari wala mere liye hogi.' Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) apne maalikon ke paas gai aur unhen yeh bataya, magar unhon ne inkar kar diya. Woh apne maalikon ke paas se wapas aai jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) maujood the, aur unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne yeh un ke samne pesh kiya magar unhon ne inkar kar diya siwae is ke ke wala in ke liye ho.' Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh suna to un se poocha, aur Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne Aap ko bataya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Use khareedo aur in ke liye wala ki shart laga lo, kyunke wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.' To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne aisa kiya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon mein khade hue, Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur sana ki, phir farmaya: 'Amma ba'd! Un logon ko kya hai jo aisi sharten lagate hain jo Allah Ta'ala ki Kitab mein nahin? Jo shart Allah ki Kitab mein nahin woh batil hai agarche sau sharten hon. Allah ka faisla zyada haqdar hai aur Us ki shart zyada mazboot hai. Aur wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"1075","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se ek doosri sanad se isi tarah marvi hai."
"1076","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak wala us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"1077","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek laundi khareed kar aazad karne ka irada kiya. To is ke maalikon ne kaha: 'Ham use tumhen is shart par bechte hain ke is ki wala hamare liye hogi.' To unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh tumhen na roke, kyunke wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"1078","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Sa'id ne Amrah se baghair Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ka zikr kiye riwayat kiya, aur woh mursal hai."
"1079","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) mere paas aai aur kaha: 'Main ne apne maalikon se nau ooqiya chaandi par har saal ek ooqiya ada karne ki kitabat ki hai, to meri madad karen.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne un se kaha: 'Agar tumhare maalik chahen to main unhen yeh maal de dun, lekin tumhari wala mere liye hogi.' Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) apne maalikon ke paas gai aur phir wapas aai jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) maujood the. Unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne yeh muamla un ke samne pesh kiya, magar unhon ne inkar kar diya siwae is ke ke wala un ke paas rahe.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh suna aur un se is ke bare mein poocha, to Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne Aap ko poori baat batai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use khareedo aur wala ki shart laga lo, kyunke wala us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.' To Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne aisa kiya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon mein khade hue, Allah ki hamd ki, aur farmaya: 'Un logon ko kya hai jo aisi sharten lagate hain jo Allah Ta'ala ki Kitab mein nahin? Woh batil hai agarche sau sharten hon. Allah ka faisla zyada haqdar hai aur Us ki shart zyada mazboot hai. Aur wala sirf us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"1080","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek laundi khareed kar aazad karne ka irada kiya. To maalik ne kaha: 'Ham use tumhen is shart par bechte hain ke is ki wala hamare liye hogi.' Jab Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya to Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh tumhen na roke, aur beshak wala us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"1081","[AI-translation] Amrah bint Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) madad mangne aai, to Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: 'Agar tumhare maalik chahen ke main unhen tumhari qeemat ek hi martaba de dun aur tumhen aazad kar dun to main karungi.' To Barirah (Raziyallahu anha) ne yeh apne maalikon se zikr kiya. To unhon ne kaha: 'Nahin, siwae is ke ke tumhari wala hamare liye hogi.' Imam Malik ne farmaya ke Yahya ne kaha: Amrah ka khayal hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh shart tumhen na roke. Use khareedo aur aazad karo, kyunke wala us ke liye hai jo aazad kare.'"
"1082","[AI-translation] Banu Sulaim ke Sunain bin Abi Jamilah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein unhon ne sadak par padi hui bachi ko paya, to woh use Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas lae. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Tumhen is jaan ko uthane par kis ne ubhara?' Us ne kaha: 'Woh zaya ho rahi thi to main ne use utha liya.' Mere sardar ne un se kaha: 'Aey Ameerul Momineen! Woh naik aadmi hai.' Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Kya aisa hai?' Us ne kaha: 'Han.' Phir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Jao, yeh bacha aazad hai, is ki wala tumhare liye hai, aur is ka kharcha hamari zimmedari hai.'"
"1083","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin Haris bin Hisham se riwayat hai ke As bin Hisham faut ho gaya aur us ne teen bete chhode: Do sage bhai aur ek sautele bhai. Phir sage bhaiyon mein se ek faut ho gaya aur us ne maal aur aazad karda ghulam wirse mein chhode. To is ke sage bhai ne is ke maal aur is ke aazad karda ghulamon ki wala ka wirsa paya. Phir woh faut ho gaya jis ne maal aur aazad karda ghulamon ki wala ka wirsa paya tha, aur us ne apna beta aur apna sautele bhai chhoda. To is ke bete ne kaha: 'Main ne woh paya jo mere walid ne paya tha maal aur aazad karda ghulamon ki wala mein se.' Magar is ke bhai ne kaha: 'Muamla aisa nahin hai, kyunke tum ne maal ka wirsa paya hai, lekin ghulamon ki wala ka nahin. Batao, agar mera bhai aaj faut ho jae to kya main is ka waris nahin hounga?' To un donon ne apna jhagda Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas pesh kiya, aur unhon ne bhai ke haq mein aazad karda ghulamon ki wala ka faisla diya."
"1084","[AI-translation] Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat hai ke Tariq bin Muraqqa' ne apne ghar walon ko saibah karke aazad kiya, phir in ka wirsa aaya. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Yeh Tariq ke warison ko de do,' magar unhon ne use lene se inkar kar diya. To Umar ne farmaya: 'Use logon mein se in jaise mein de do.'"
"1085","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Tariq bin Marqa' ne Yaman walon mein se chand gharon walon ko saibah karke aazad kiya. Phir unhon ne das hazaar se kuch zyada wirsa chhoda. Jab yeh muamla Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke samne zikr hua to unhon ne mujhe hukm diya ke yeh Tariq ko ya Tariq ke warison ko wapas dun. Is muamle mein mujhe kuch shak hai."
"1086","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wala ki khareed farokht ya use tohfe mein dene se mana farmaya."
"1087","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Wala moahida ke darje mein hai, main use wahin rakhta hun jahan Allah Ta'ala ne use rakha hai.'"
"1088","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wala ki khareed farokht aur use tohfe mein dene se mana farmaya."
"1089","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wala ki khareed farokht aur use tohfe mein dene se mana farmaya."
"1090","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Wala gosht ki tarah hai jaise nasab ka gosht hai, na yeh bechi jati hai aur na tohfe mein di jati hai.'"
"1091","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kahte suna: Abu Mazkoor Uzrah qabeela ka ek aadmi tha. Us ka ek Qibti ghulam tha jise us ne apne baad aazad kiya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ghulam ke bare mein suna to is ghulam ko bech diya aur farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi mohtaj ho to use apne nafs se aaghaz karna chahiye. Agar is ke paas izafi maal ho to use apne nafs ke sath un se aaghaz karna chahiye jin ki woh kafalat karta hai. Phir agar is ke baad izafi maal pae to use in ke siwa par sadqa karna chahiye.' Muslim bin Khalid ne hadees mein kuch izafa kiya hai."
"1092","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne apne ghulam ko apne baad aazad kiya jabke is ke paas is ke siwa koi maal na tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujh se use kaun khareedega?' To Nu'aim bin Abdullah ne use aath sau dirham mein khareeda aur use is ki qeemat di."
"1093","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"1094","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Banu Uzrah ka ek aadmi ne apne baad ghulam aazad kiya. To yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahuncha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tumhare paas is ke siwa maal hai?' To us ne kaha: Nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujh se use kaun khareedega?' To Nu'aim bin Abdullah Adawi ne use aath sau dirham mein khareeda. Phir woh use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya aur Aap ko de diya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne nafs se aaghaz karo aur us par sadqa karo. Agar tumhare nafs se kuch bach jae to tumhare ghar walon ke liye. Agar kuch bach jae to tumhare rishtedaron ke liye. Agar tumhare rishtedaron se kuch bach jae to is tarah aur is tarah, yani tumhare daen aur baen.'"
"1095","[AI-translation] Amr bin Dinar aur Abu Zubair se riwayat hai, un donon ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kahte suna: Ham mein se ek aadmi ne ghulam ko mudabbar banaya jabke is ke paas is ke siwa koi maal na tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujh se use kaun khareedega?' To Nu'aim bin Nahham ne use khareed liya. Amr ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ko kahte suna: Qibti ghulam tha jo Ibn Zubair ki hukumat mein pahle saal faut hua. Abu Zubair ne izafa kiya: Is ka naam Ya'qub tha."
"1096","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Main ne use is se apni poori umr isi tarah suna. Phir main ne apni kitab mein paya: Ham mein se ek aadmi ne ghulam ko mudabbar banaya phir woh faut ho gaya. To ya to yeh meri kitab ki ghalti hai ya Sufyan ki ghalti hai. Agar Sufyan ki hai to Ibn Juraij Abu Zubair ki hadees ko Sufyan se zyada yaad rakhne wala hai, aur Ibn Juraij ke sath Lais aur ghair ki hadees hai. Aur Abu Zubair hadees ko had bandi ke sath bayan karta hai jis mein woh is ke mudabbar banane wale ki zindagi ki khabar deta hai. Aur Hammad bin Zaid, Hammad bin Salamah aur ghair Hammad Amr ki hadees ko akele Sufyan se zyada yaad rakhne wale hain. Aur kabhi hadees ke hifz par is ki ghalti se us se kam par istidlal kiya jata hai jo main ne Ibn Juraij aur Lais ki Abu Zubair se hadees mein paya. Aur Hammad ki Amr se hadees mein aur ghair Hammad jo use Amr se riwayat karte hain jaise Hammad bin Zaid ne use riwayat kiya. Aur mujhe ek se zyada ne khabar di jinhen Sufyan bin Uyainah se qadeem mulaqat hui ke woh apni hadees mein 'faut ho gaya' dakhil nahin karta tha, aur in mein se baaz ne ta'ajjub kiya jab main ne unhen khabar di ke main ne apni kitab mein 'faut ho gaya' paya. Unhon ne kaha: Shayad yeh is ki ghalti ya laghzish hai jo main ne is se yaad ki."
"1097","[AI-translation] Umrah se riwayat hai ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne apni ek laundi ko mudabbar banaya tha to us ne un par jadu kar diya. To us ne jadu ka iqrar kar liya aur Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne hukm diya ke use dehatiyon ko becha jae jo is se bura sulook karen. To use bech diya gaya."
"1098","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Sabit ne mukatab ke bare mein farmaya: 'Woh ghulam hai jab tak is par ek dirham baqi hai.'"
"1099","[AI-translation] Isma'il bin Umayyah se riwayat hai ke Nafi' ne khabar di ke Abdullah bin Umar ne apne ghulam se tees hazar par kitabat ki. Phir woh in ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Main aajiz ho gaya hun.' To unhon ne kaha: 'To main tumhari kitabat mita dunga.' To us ne kaha: 'Main aajiz ho gaya hun, tum use mita do.' Nafi' ne kaha: To main ne use ishara kiya: Mita do jabke woh ummeed rakhta tha ke woh use aazad karega. To ghulam ne use mita diya aur is ke do bete ya ek beta tha. Ibn Umar ne farmaya: 'Meri laundi se alag raho.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir Ibn Umar ne is ke baad is ke bete ko aazad kar diya."
"1100","[AI-translation] Ajlan Abi Muhammad se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ghulam ke liye khana aur kapda maroof ke sath hai, aur use kaam ki takleef na di jae siwae is ke jis ki woh taqat rakhta ho.'"
"1101","[AI-translation] Utbah bin Abi Lahab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko ghulamon se kahte suna: 'Unhen khilao jo tum khate ho, aur unhen pahnao jo tum pahante ho.'"
"1102","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ka khadim use khana pakane ki garmi aur dhuwen se kifayat kare to use bulana chahiye aur bithana chahiye. Agar woh inkar kare to use ek luqma laga kar dena chahiye aur use dena chahiye' ya is hum-ma'na kalima."
